Dear Residents,


Please be advised that on Monday, November 17th, and Tuesday, November 18th, 2025, our Maintenance Team and Cintas Fire Protection will conduct the annual fire alarm and sprinkler inspections throughout the community.


Inspections will take place between 9:00 AM &ndash; 5:00 PM, and brief access to apartment homes will be required for a 4&ndash;5-minute visual inspection of sprinkler heads. Audibles will be sounding consistently and intermittently throughout the inspection(s).

Schedule:
	- Monday, November 17th: Buildings 1, 2, 3, 5 & 6
	- Tuesday, November 18th: Buildings 4 & 7
 
Reminders:
	- Pets: Please keep all pets restrained or crated during your scheduled inspection window.
	- Access: Ensure closets and bathrooms are accessible and free of clutter.
	- Alarms: Fire alarms will sound intermittently throughout the day during testing.
 

These inspections are state required to ensure the continued safety of our community. Thank you for your cooperation and understanding. If you have any questions, please contact the Leasing Office by email or through the Resident App.


 

The Avalon at Cahill Park Team 

Avalon at Cahill Park

754 The Alameda | San Jose, CA 95126


Connect with us at (408) 292-7778



